---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={'Work with Mikka'} description={'Need it done rather than figured out? Marketing systems, growth and content for founders and small teams.'} current="work">
    <section class="hero page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow reveal-up"><span class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>Taking on <span class="ph">[N]</span> projects this quarter</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title" aria-label="Need it done rather than figured out?">
          <span class="line"><span class="line__inner">Need it <em>done</em></span></span>
          <span class="line"><span class="line__inner">rather than</span></span>
          <span class="line"><span class="line__inner">figured out?</span></span>
        </h1>
        <div class="reveal-up" style="--d:.5s">
          <p class="lead">
            Sometimes you don't want the experiment, you want the result. I work with a small number of founders and teams who need marketing that runs on systems instead of heroics.
          </p>
          <!-- TODO: replace with your booking link or email -->
          <a href="mailto:hello@example.com" class="btn btn--accent">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">What I can do for you</p>
          <h2 class="h2">An in-house generalist, <em>without the hire.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="services">
          <article class="card reveal">
            <h3 class="h3">Growth systems</h3>
            <p>Repeatable client acquisition that doesn't depend on the founder's network.</p>
            <ul><li>Outbound &amp; inbound tracks</li><li>Positioning &amp; messaging</li><li>Channel testing</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="card reveal" style="--d:.08s">
            <h3 class="h3">Content that travels</h3>
            <p>Content built on what actually makes people watch, share and reply.</p>
            <ul><li>Content strategy</li><li>Short-form video</li><li>Email &amp; newsletters</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="card reveal" style="--d:.16s">
            <h3 class="h3">AI &amp; automation</h3>
            <p>Remove the manual work so a small team can do what normally takes a big one.</p>
            <ul><li>Workflow automation</li><li>AI-assisted research &amp; ops</li><li>Tool stack setup</li></ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Simple, <em>on purpose.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="process reveal">
          <li><strong>Intro call</strong><p>30 minutes to understand the problem and whether I'm the right fit.</p></li>
          <li><strong>Diagnosis</strong><p>I figure out what actually matters and what we can skip.</p></li>
          <li><strong>Build</strong><p>We set up the system, test it on real work and fix what breaks.</p></li>
          <li><strong>Hand-off</strong><p>You get a system your team can run without me.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="quiet-line reveal">
      <div class="container">
        <p>Rather figure it out yourself? <a href="/#subscribe" class="link-underline">Get the weekly experiment</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
</Base>
